Description: FlickOS security kit: wireless testing
 Aircrack-ng, Reaver, Wifite, hcxdumptool and hcxtools, iw and macchanger
 from Debian. They need administrator rights and an adapter that can do
 monitor mode.
 .
 Use a second, USB adapter and start it with airmon-ng start alone.
 airmon-ng check kill stops this computer's own network; if you ran it,
 sudo systemctl start NetworkManager brings it back.
 .
 Use these tools only on computers and networks you own or have permission
 to test.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Security Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used
 (docs/design/flickos-security.md).
